# Keep binary assets byte-exact.
#
# This repo is committed from Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which makes Git
# treat unrecognized files as text and rewrite their line endings on commit and
# checkout. For a PDF or an image that silently corrupts the file. Marking them
# binary turns that off.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Web sources are text; normalize to LF in the repo regardless of platform.
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
